A public fork or clone does not by itself authorize modification or reuse.

3. Authorized team development
A person expressly authorized in writing by the project copyright holders
(or their authorized representative) to develop AndThen may copy, run, test,
and modify the project solely for the team's AndThen project, submit changes
to its designated repository, and deploy it on the team's behalf within the
